---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/policy.css';

const lastUpdated = 'April 9, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - tecloudz"
  description="Privacy Policy for tecloudz. Learn how we protect your data and prioritize your privacy."
>
  <main class="policy-container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="policy-content">
      <p>
        At <strong>tecloudz</strong>, privacy isn't a checkbox — it's the foundation of how we
        operate. This policy explains what little data we collect and why.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect minimal server-side log data as part of standard web hosting. This may include
        your IP address, browser type, and the pages you visit. These logs are used solely for
        debugging and security purposes, are never sold or shared with third parties, and are
        rotated regularly.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        tecloudz does not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or third-party analytics.
        We do not run ads. We do not track you across sites. Any cookies set are strictly
        functional — for example, storing your theme preference — and contain no personally
        identifiable information.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any other third-party tracking or
        advertising service. External links on this site point to third-party websites with their
        own privacy policies, which we do not control.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Data</h2>
      <p>
        We do not collect accounts, emails, or personal profiles. If you contact us via email,
        your message is used only to respond to your inquiry and is never shared.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we make meaningful changes to this policy, we'll update the date above. We'll never
        quietly introduce tracking or advertising without clearly stating so.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions? Reach us at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:hello@tecloudz.com">hello@tecloudz.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>